__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.venv/
scratch/*
# the gate tooling stands in the versioned record, not in the throwaway: the pin set and the
# batteries are the acceptance the work is verified against, and a change to one is a change the
# record can diff and revert. The probes and logs beside them stay throwaway.
!scratch/check_*.py
!scratch/check_page.cjs
!scratch/e2e_*.cjs
!scratch/face_boot.cjs
!scratch/face_files.cjs
!scratch/run_battery.sh
# the face's estate for the operator's files (attach.write_files): one home per workspace the runs stand
# in, made on the request that needs it — machine state, never tree content
.sahw/
# the e2e's live-check runs (a fresh runs root per run; disposable, never tree content — SAH's own
# gitignore keeps /runs/ the same way)
runs/
.pi/
.coverage
# machine config: a local .env would hold this box's endpoints; .env.example (the shape) stays
# tracked — the pattern is SAH's
.env
